      "message": "fix(tests): re-record pins after #2504/#2488, per-process ui demo dir\n\n- examples/first-router-part.nc: the drill cycle depth is Z-14.803, not\n  Z-13. #2504 saved the example at v68 with break_through_from\n  full_diameter; the extra 1.803 mm is the point of the 6 mm 118 deg\n  drill. #2488 recorded the pin in parallel.\n- thread_mill_m8_multi_form.nc, thread_mill_external_m8_multi_form.nc:\n  only the T, H and tool comment lines change. #2488 numbers tools at\n  AddTool in the order of addition.\n- guide_projects.rs: the demo projects go to a directory of the test\n  process. The fixed /tmp/camcraft-guide-projects failed on the runner\n  with \"Permission denied\" because another account owned it.\n\nFixes #2543\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
